stateDiagram-v2
  %% Derived from the DCL MediaItemLifecycle in ../media-content-management.dcl.

  [*] --> Uploaded

  Uploaded --> Analysed: MediaFileAnalysed
  Uploaded --> Failed: AnalysisDeferred

  Analysed --> Processing: MediaAnalysed

  Processing --> ReadyForApproval: ThumbnailGenerated
  Processing --> ReadyForApproval: VideoTranscoded
  Processing --> Failed: ThumbnailDeferred
  Processing --> Failed: TranscodeDeferred

  ReadyForApproval --> Approved: ContentApprovedForPublishing
  ReadyForApproval --> Rejected: ContentRejected

  Approved --> Published: PlaylistUpdated
  Approved --> Failed: PlaylistPublicationDeferred

  Published --> [*]
  Rejected --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]

  note right of Processing
    Current DCL lifecycle syntax models
    processing completion signals as transitions.
    It does not express a guarded video join
    requiring both thumbnail and transcoding.
  end note
